kages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Amendment ledger applied: per-intake legs re-cut for turn grouping, old TC-4.3 floor legs superseded (note left pointing at TC-5.2), construction tests moved to two-field budgets plus the floorTokens-rejected leg, TC-4.6 heal re-cut to multi-turn batches, seam-direction-two re-cut to the 64k/32k defaults; status zoneTokens assertions kept (shared-query invariant)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/boundary-g1-trajectory.json\",\"reason\":\"G1 re-cut for turn grouping and turn-end trigger: 6 batches covering under-max closes, whole-turn eviction with peek-ahead, no-move close, mid-turn over-max hold, and the healing close that evicts three groups\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/view-select-golden.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"BoundaryGolden budgets type reduced to two fields; G1 comments updated to the turn-end contract (replay-equality leg unchanged)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/README.md\",\"reason\":\"boundary-g1-trajectory row updated to describe the re-cut rule set\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/view-boundary.ts\",\"reason\":\"New boundary fixture: boundaryTokens/boundaryToolRun/turnedToolResultEvents/seedTurnedToolResults — scripted closed/open/turnless turns seeded through real intake commits\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"Re-export the new boundary fixture helpers\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/view-fixture.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Construction legs: target<floor leg replaced by floorTokens-unknown rejection; defaults assertion updated to 64000/32000\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/inspect-view.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Boundary-advanced fixture leg: floorTokens dropped from small budgets (same expected positions under turn grouping); comment updated\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/view-pull.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Status leg's default maxTokens expectation 32000 → 64000 (downstream of AC-5.4 defaults)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\",\"reason\":\"Regenerated hashes for the amended/new Red-phase files after applying the amendment ledger\"}],\"storyScopedAssessment\":\"Latest bounded child-operation changes remain scoped to the active story.\"},\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"story-gate-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\"],\"reasoning\":\"Story gate cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all reported pass.\"},{\"name\":\"final-verifier-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/005-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/008-verify.json\"],\"reasoning\":\"Final verifier outcome is pass.\"},{\"name\":\"unresolved-findings-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No unresolved verifier findings remain.\"},{\"name\":\"scope-change-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No scope changes require further ruling.\"},{\"name\":\"production-path-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No production-path decisions require further approval.\"},{\"name\":\"baseline-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"baselineBefore=369\",\"baselineAfter=376\"],\"reasoning\":\"The current baseline did not drop below the prior accepted baseline.\"},{\"name\":\"receipt-readiness\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/003-implementor.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/005-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/008-verify.json\"],\"reasoning\":\"Receipt draft includes implementor evidence, verifier evidence, and a passing story gate.\"},{\"name\":\"commit-readiness\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"ready-for-impl-lead-commit\"],\"reasoning\":\"The story is ready for impl-lead to create the required commit.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-5.1 turn-end-only advance\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: focused suite passed for turn-end-only advance, mid-turn no movement, byte-identical open-turn pulls, and small-close no movement.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Verifier confirmed the production gate only advances after committed turn_end batches.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-5.2 whole-turn eviction\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: focused suite passed for whole-turn all-or-nothing eviction and turnless singleton grouping.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Verifier found no partial-turn eviction in the covered production behavior.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-5.3 peek-ahead and protections\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: F-06-002 resolved; story AC and tech design explicitly define the landing-window exception; production-path probe passed with boundary 3 and zoneTokens 130.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Impl-lead ruling authorizes protected-tail landing-window exceptions, and verifier confirmed code/tests/spec wording align.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-5.4 visibility config\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: focused suite passed for 64k/32k defaults and maxTokens > targetTokens validation.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Verifier confirmed floorTokens is retired and the two-field config contract holds.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-5.5 Epic 03 remaining contracts\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: focused suite passed for forward-only behavior, deterministic replay, compact reset, and post-commit failure healing.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Verifier confirmed the remaining visibility-boundary contracts under the new trigger.\"},{\"name\":\"Story and epic gates\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: `pnpm run verify` passed.\",\"008-verify: `pnpm run verify-all` passed.\",\"008-verify: focused suite is 20/20 passing; full verify and verify-all are 377 passed with 9 env-gated skips.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Configured story gate and epic gate evidence are present in the latest verifier result.\"}],\"callerInputHistory\":{\"reviewRequests\":[],\"rulings\":[{\"rulingRequestId\":\"06-turn-end-boundary-advance-story-run-001-ruling-020\",\"decision\":\"Allow landing-window exception for protected trailing-turnless-after-newest-closed zones\",\"rationale\":\"Approved: AC-5.3's protections are authoritative over the landing window when they conflict. The spec itself already contains this precedent — TC-5.2 requires the newest closed turn to remain intact even when it alone exceeds target, which necessarily lands the zone above target + one turn. Trailing turnless singleton groups positioned after the newest closed turn cannot be evicted without first evicting the protected newest turn, because the boundary is a positional marker advanced oldest-first; their protection is structural, not a new rule. Therefore the landing guarantee [target, target + one turn) applies only when achievable without violating the explicit protections. Keep current implementation and tests; update AC-5.3/tech-design wording to state the exception explicitly; rerun verification. This ruling will be surfaced at epic review for ratification.\",\"source\":\"impl-lead\"}]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"NEEDS_RULING\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":\"06-turn-end-boundary-advance\",\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":\"story-orchestrate\",\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"bb1f3fcf-4d78-4a97-8c5b-320e502ce14a\",\"storyId\":\"06-turn-end-boundary-advance\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ebe41-765c-7120-9569-abc227abbd04\",\"storyId\":\"06-turn-end-boundary-advance\"}},\"storyReceiptDraft\":{\"storyId\":\"06-turn-end-boundary-advance\",\"storyTitle\":\"Story 6: Turn-End Boundary Advance\",\"implementorEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/003-implementor.json\"],\"verifierEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/005-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/008-verify.json\"],\"gateCommand\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"gateResult\":\"pass\",\"dispositions\":[{\"id\":\"F-06-001\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"005-verify: resolved by code/test evidence and production-path probe after quick-fix 002.\"]},{\"id\":\"F-06-002\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify: resolved after impl-lead ruling and quick-fix 003; no open findings remain.\"]}],\"baselineBeforeStory\":369,\"baselineAfterStory\":376,\"openRisks\":[]},\"cumulativeBaseline\":{\"baselineBeforeCurrentStory\":369,\"expectedAfterCurrentStory\":376,\"latestActualTotal\":376},\"commitReadiness\":{\"state\":\"ready-for-impl-lead-commit\"},\"openRisks\":[]},\"cleanu