next protected turn 45, expected window is [60, 105), so 115 violates the literal window.\",\"Story technical notes say newest closed turn and trailing turnless singletons after it are never candidates.\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"Allow landing-window exception for protected trailing-turnless-after-newest-closed zones\",\"Require trailing turnless singletons to be evictable to preserve the landing window\",\"Reject both and block this story for a redesigned boundary model\"]},\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"ask-ruling\"},\"startedFromPrimitiveArtifacts\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/001-story-validate.json\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"story-run-current\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/001-current.json\"},{\"kind\":\"story-run-events\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\"},{\"kind\":\"story-run-final-package\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/001-final-package.json\"},{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/002-story-orchestrate-run.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-12T23:36:12.511Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-13T00:08:11.481Z\"}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/preflight/004-preflight.json:1:{\"command\":\"preflight\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready\",\"result\":{\"status\":\"ready\",\"validatedConfig\":{\"version\":1,\"primary_