ce/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/006-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"Removed two CLI-only ErrorCode union members (`empty_stdin`, `provider_not_configured`) beyond the named export deletions — their only consumers were the deleted CLI adapter and process suites; leaving them would be dead resolution vocabulary contrary to the anti-shim requirements.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/006-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"In-process CLI parity legs inside default behavior suites (25 tests across 9 files, plus the twinThreads fixture and FC-0.6) were removed in addition to the twelve spawned suites named by the story — the CLI surface they drove no longer exists; each was parity-only and the red-manifest amendment path was used.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/006-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"assumedRisks\":[],\"scopeChanges\":[],\"productionPathDecisionItems\":[]},\"diffReview\":{\"changedFiles\":[],\"storyScopedAssessment\":\"Story-lead package is scoped to orchestration evidence and impl-lead handoff data.\"},\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"story-gate-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"cd packages/lhc && node scripts/check-test-immutability.mjs\"],\"reasoning\":\"Story gate cd packages/lhc && node scripts/check-test-immutability.mjs reported pass.\"},{\"name\":\"final-verifier-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-h