ripted call shows exactly one invocation; stable reason\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:299:- `network` to exhaustion → `failed`, `provider_failure`, `metadata.lastError` preserved\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:309:- keyed: each of seven kinds round-trips once → `ready`, non-empty, no marker pattern\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:310:- unkeyed (controlled: suite re-invoked with key stripped from env in a subprocess-free way — the guard function called directly with empty env) → `notRan` record with reason; assert the record's shape and that it is not a pass\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:311:- the suite-level guard emits exactly one ran/not-ran line into the run output\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:341:- failure injection at `post-commit-advance` → intake unaffected, boundary unchanged, status shows over-budget zone, next turn close heals (Epic 03's failure-injection machinery — the `post-commit-advance` hook — retriggered)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:347:- full default suite green is the suite run itself; the SDK-coverage comparison is a one-time story-completion check recorded in the story DoD (suite files and their domain-operation coverage unchanged from pre-deletion, process files excepted)\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/05-real-inference-suite-and-capstone/story-lead/promp