{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"crossStoryFindings\":[\"The six flows are coherent across the SDK surface: CLI retirement removes package bin/env registry paths, then createSdk accepts exactly one of direct provider or inference config, with assignment validation before construction.\",\"Inference, adapter, classification, and handler writes line up across stories: adapter output flows through the existing DerivationProvider seam and Epic 02 queue machinery; provenance is copied into derived-form metadata by handlers.\",\"The keyed real-inference receipt exists: /tmp/lbuild-run/keyed-run-verbose.txt shows `RAN: real-inference (model openai/gpt-5.4-mini)` and 13/13 tests passing; default gates still show visible NOT-RAN accounting when the key is absent.\"],\"architectureFindings\":[\"Architecture matches the tech design: src/inference implements the semantic adapter layer and imports shared types only; boundary check passes with 97 files checked.\",\"Provider arrival is injection-only at createSdk. package.json has no bin, src/providers/registry.ts and src/cli are absent, and source/dist scans found no LHC_PROVIDER, --provider, OpenRouter, or fetch path in production code.\",\"Turn-end boundary advance is implemented at the existing post-commit seam: intake records a committed turn_end flag, then thread-view advances whole groups using stored token estimates and the configured max/target budgets.\"],\"epicCoverageAssessment\":[\"All 22 ACs and 15 TCs have a primary story owner in stories/coverage.md, and the implemented test suite contains the expected inference, real-suite, boundary, and retirement tests.\",\"Story Gate passed: cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify completed build, typecheck, lint, boundaries, and vitest with 40 files passed, 377 tests passed, 9 keyed real-inference legs skipped with visible NOT-RAN accounting.\",\"Epic Gate passed: cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all completed the same red-verify and vitest gate successfully.\"],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"No material fake adapter, shim, placeholder, or non-real execution path was found in production inference. Production inference calls only the host-supplied ModelCall through createInferenceProvider; OpenRouter transport is confined to test fixtures.\",\"The deterministic provider remains available only by explicit direct injection, matching the test/default-provider contract; there is no registry or env fallback that silently selects it.\",\"Compact, pull, status, inspect, and thread-view boundary code do not call the model function; inference is confined to drained derivation work.\"],\"blockingFindings\":[],\"nonBlockingFindings\":[{\"id\":\"E05-NB-001\",\"severity\":\"observation\",\"title\":\"Team log has stale closeout/open-risk status text\",\"evidence\":\"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md records the keyed run receipt at lines 101-113, but still says Final Gate Status: not-run and repeats the old Story 5 BLOCKED note at lines 137-146. Current reviewer gates passed.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/team-impl-log.md\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.1\",\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":false}],\"unresolvedItems\":[],\"gateResult\":\"pass\"}"}}
